{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20132","headline":"送淡公 五 · 孟郊","name":"送淡公 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"射鸭复射鸭，鸭惊菰蒲头。\n鸳鸯亦零落，彩色难相求。\n侬是清浪儿，每踏清浪游。\n笑伊乡贡郎，踏土称风流。\n如何丱角翁，至死不裹头。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20132.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20132","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}